            +accordion-item({
              show: true,
              parentId: 'accordionOne',
              header: 'Can I track my order?'
            }).accordion-corporate
              p Yes, you can! After placing your order you will receive an order confirmation via email. Each order starts production 24 hours after your order is placed. Within 72 hours of you placing your order, you will receive an expected delivery date. When the order ships, you will receive another email with the tracking number and a link to trace the order online with the carrier.

